{
  "_comment": [
    "Which spoken phrase each moment on the page lands on. `id` is a cue id: the slide id, a colon,",
    "then the cue name the page writes. `phrase` is a word or short phrase from that section of",
    "script.md, matched ignoring case and punctuation. A section's turns share one clock, so a cue",
    "may land on any voice's words. `occurrence` picks which match, counting from 1."
  ],
  "sections": {
